- `type`, `lhs`, `rhs`: expressions representing the type, left-hand side, and right-hand side of the projection
- `args`: arguments to the projection
- `mustBeStr`: a boolean flag indicating whether the target must be a structure
- `cfg`: configuration options for the attribute
- `todo`: a list of projection names to generate (empty means generate all)
- `toApply`: a list of indices for composite projections

The function recursively processes the structure, generating lemmas for each specified projection, handling composite projections, and applying appropriate transparency settings. It ensures the generated lemmas are valid constructor applications and handles cases where manual unfolding is needed.
