1. [THEOREM] Numerator of Natural Number Cast to Rationals Equals Original Number
Module: Mathlib.Data.Rat.Defs
Name: Rat.num_natCast
Description: For any natural number $n$, the numerator of the rational number corresponding to $n$ is equal to $n$ itself.
