Module: Mathlib.Data.ENNReal.Operations
Name: ENNReal.exists_le_of_sum_le
Description: For any nonempty finite set $s$ and any functions $f, g \colon \alpha \to \mathbb{R}_{\geq 0} \cup \{\infty\}$, if the sum of $f$ over $s$ is less than or equal to the sum of $g$ over $s$, then there exists an element $i \in s$ such that $f(i) \leq g(i)$. In other words,
