Module: Mathlib.Order.Interval.Set.Basic
Name: Set.Icc_eq_singleton_iff
Description: For any elements $a$, $b$, and $c$ in a preorder $\alpha$, the closed interval $[a, b]$ is equal to the singleton set $\{c\}$ if and only if $a = c$ and $b = c$.
