Signature:  {u : ℝ → E} {a b : ℝ} (hu : AntitoneOn u (uIcc a b)) : IntervalIntegrable u μ a b

2. [THEOREM] Image of $[a, \infty)$ under antitone function is contained in $(-\infty, f(a)]$
Module: Mathlib.Order.Interval.Set.Image
Name: AntitoneOn.image_Ici_subset
